      "text": "Linear SVM:\r\nThe working of the SVM algorithm can be understood by using an example. Suppose we\r\nhave a dataset that has two tags (green and blue), and the dataset has two features\r\nx1and x2. We want a classifier that can classify the pair (x1, x2) of coordinates in either\r\ngreen or blue. Consider the below image:",
